{"root":"rusuh","ipa":"/ru.suh/","core":"形容词：混乱的、骚乱的、不安宁的；动词：制造骚乱、扰乱。","pos":["形容词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","工作","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ru.suh/","zh":"形容局势、环境或心理状态的混乱、动荡或不安。","phrases":[{"t":"situasi rusuh","zh":"混乱的局势"},{"t":"keadaan rusuh","zh":"骚乱的状态"},{"t":"rusuh hati","zh":"心烦意乱"}],"examples":[{"t":"Demonstrasi itu berubah menjadi rusuh.","zh":"那场示威游行演变成了骚乱。"},{"t":"Jangan membuat suasana menjadi rusuh.","zh":"不要把气氛搞得混乱不堪。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"rusuh","ipa":"/ru.suh/","zh":"混乱的、骚乱的","phrase":{"t":"daerah rusuh","zh":"骚乱地区"},"example":{"t":"Kota itu sedang rusuh.","zh":"那座城市正处于骚乱中。"}},{"w":"merusuh","ipa":"/mə.ru.suh/","zh":"制造骚乱、进行破坏","phrase":{"t":"orang merusuh","zh":"制造骚乱的人"},"example":{"t":"Sekelompok orang mulai merusuh di pasar.","zh":"一群人在市场上开始制造骚乱。"}},{"w":"merusuhi","ipa":"/mə.ru.su.hi/","zh":"扰乱某人或某事","phrase":{"t":"merusuhi ketenangan","zh":"扰乱宁静"},"example":{"t":"Dia datang untuk merusuhi rapat kami.","zh":"他来扰乱我们的会议。"}},{"w":"kerusuhan","ipa":"/kə.ru.su.han/","zh":"骚乱、暴乱（名词）","phrase":{"t":"terjadi kerusuhan","zh":"发生骚乱"},"example":{"t":"Polisi berusaha mengendalikan kerusuhan itu.","zh":"警察试图控制那场骚乱。"}},{"w":"perusuh","ipa":"/pə.ru.suh/","zh":"骚乱者、暴徒","phrase":{"t":"menangkap perusuh","zh":"逮捕暴徒"},"example":{"t":"Para perusuh telah diamankan oleh pihak berwajib.","zh":"暴徒们已被当局控制。"}}],"derSlugs":["rusuh","merusuh","merusuhi","kerusuhan","perusuh"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:56:04.975Z","src":"base"}